# PART 1: PROJECT VISION AND DEVELOPMENT OBJECTIVE

Act as an elite team of senior Android developers, SaaS architects, Kotlin/Flutter engineers, AI and OCR specialists, financial technology engineers, database architects, cybersecurity specialists, UI/UX designers, DevOps engineers and product managers.

Your assignment is to design, develop, test, deploy and maintain a complete, professional, secure and scalable commercial Android application called **1803Receipts**.

1803Receipts is a subscription-based business receipt generation platform owned and operated by 1803 CONSULT.

The application will serve independent Nigerian business owners, entrepreneurs, retailers, educational consultants, service providers, freelancers, small businesses and registered companies.

Its primary purpose is to allow business owners to upload bank transaction receipts, automatically extract transaction information, enter the customer's name and payment purpose, and generate a professional Nigerian business payment receipt bearing their own business logo, identity and brand colours.

The application must also provide business owners with customer management, transaction history, financial reporting, receipt verification, cloud backup and business analytics.

1803 CONSULT will operate the platform through a dedicated Super Admin system that monitors registered businesses, subscriptions, payments, subscription revenue, application usage and platform performance.

**This must be a genuine production SaaS application, not a demo, prototype, test project or static interface.**

